            "tooltip": "User prompt — sent directly to MiniMaxH3ImageToVideo / ReferenceToVideo. r2v: <Picture 1>. v2v: source-timeline edit (<Video 1>). rv2v: source timeline + reference images (<Video 1> + <Picture N>)."
